      "rollercoaster screaming"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 9,
     "text": "and the ending.",
     "queries": [
      "sunset",
      "finish line runner"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 10,
     "text": "So always end on a high, for others and yourself.",
