      "to do list",
      "sticky notes",
      "checklist notebook"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "And there's a simple fix.",
     "queries": [
      "writing notebook",
      "pen paper"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "Unfinished goals keep popping into your head,",
     "queries": [
      "woman thinking",
      "stressed office worker"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "because your brain treats them as open loops.",
     "queries": [
      "spinning wheel",
      "carousel spinning",
      "brain"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "In one study, people with an unfinished goal",
